      "id": "2055283789874815235",
      "text": "RT @tetsuoai: 40 Grok Build agents tearing through C code in parallel. All supervised by DAD.\n\nDAD is a lightweight autonomous tmux supervi…",
      "created_at": "Fri May 15 13:46:55 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": {
        "id": "2055212910146719773",
        "text": "40 Grok Build agents tearing through C code in parallel. All supervised by DAD.\n\nDAD is a lightweight autonomous tmux supervisor for long-running Grok tasks. Built entirely in Grok Build.\n\n/dad \"your objective\" launches grok --yolo (the Son) and spins up two loops:\n\n2-min fast loop: nudges only when the Son is stuck, frozen, finished, or waiting. Hands off in Plan mode.\n\n12-min deep loop: re-reads the objective, pushes back if the Son lowers the bar, triggers /compact at ~50% context.\n\nRe-attachable. Walk back to a DAD-* window hours later and Dad rehydrates the loops.\n\nSet and forget. Dad watches, the Son works.",
        "created_at": "Fri May 15 09:05:16 +0000 2026",
        "lang": "en",
        "media": [
          {
            "type": "photo",
            "id": "2055209199311982592",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HIWR4LgbEAAoAML.jpg"
          }
        ],
        "retweet": null,
        "quoted": {
          "id": "2054993285152989373",
          "text": "An early beta of Grok Build, an agentic CLI for coding, building apps, and automating workflows is now available for SuperGrok Heavy subscribers.\n\nThrough this early beta, we will improve the model and product based on your feedback.\n\nTry it at https://t.co/bpTHpjivWD https://t.co/Rlg4qMLkrv",
